Subject: [PATCH] GB-Link: team-only cartridge read (Gen 3) and import

Reads just the trainer info and party sections through the agent's ranged
reads instead of the whole 128 KiB save. 'Read the whole save' checkbox
restores the full dump. Falls back to the full read for other agents/games.

